  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDC Research: Impact of investment in large firms in Low Income Countries (Research/Uptake/Admin)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build the evidence base on investments by Development Finance Institutions (DFIs). The PEDL/BII partnership has enabled FCDO to match researchers with BII and align research outcomes with investments to ensure that the impact of these are enhanced.</narrative>
  </description>
